SY_TALK("AnsnyDMayQY",[[424,["Can we start with Your childhood?"]],[427,["-Yes.","- Do You, can describe a little bit"]],[429,["the circumstances where you were grown up?"]],[433,["- My family?","- Yes."]],[440,["I belong to a family of very enlightened people."]],[447,["My father was a linguist"]],[452,["and he was master of fourteen languages."]],[455,["He knew about twenty-six languages"]],[458,["and he translated even Koran-e-Sharif into Hindi language."]],[465,["My Mother was in those days"]],[471,["was a honors in mathematics."]],[475,["So both were very well educated and enlightened people."]],[485,["At the time of My birth,"]],[489,["My mother dreamt"]],[494,["something which she could not explain,"]],[496,["but after that she had a great desire to go and see a tiger"]],[500,["in the open field."]],[503,["My father was a great hunter,"]],[506,["because tigers were a menace in the area where we were living."]],[510,["It was a hill station called Chhindwara."]],[514,["So there was a king who was very much interested in My father."]],[518,["Somehow or the other a letter came that"]],[521,["there’s a tiger, a very big tiger that has appeared"]],[525,["and they are frightened of him that he might be a man-eater."]],[529,["So My father took My Mother and Me to that place."]],[536,["And they were sitting what we call as a machhan,"]],[539,["where they built something, for people to sit on top of a tree,"]],[545,["from where they can shoot nicely."]],[550,["And then My mother tells Me that a big huge tiger"]],[554,["of a very big size, very beautifully appeared on the field."]],[560,["And she felt tremendous love for the tiger."]],[564,["It was a full moon day and she felt"]],[570,["extremely compassionate towards the tiger."]],[574,["And when My father raised his gun to shoot,"]],[577,["she stopped him and she wouldn’t allow him."]],[580,["And the tiger went away and he never came to that forest again."]],[586,["But that made My father think -"]],[588,["because he himself was a realized soul -"]],[591,["that must be somebody,"]],[596,["what we call a Goddess Durga who is fond of  a tiger"]],[601,["must be born to My mother,"]],[605,["because the symptoms were rather funny"]],[608,["that a lady should like to see a tiger and all."]],[611,["So he told My mother, “Now are you satisfied?”"]],[613,["because they were struggling with the gun."]],[615,["He said, “Is there a Durga sitting in your womb"]],[618,["that you are trying to protect the tiger?”"]],[622,["She said, “Yes, yes, so stop it now. I won’t allow you.”"]],[626,["Like that there were many incidents in My life"]],[628,["because I am of a Christian family – protestants –"]],[634,["and when I was born My mother didn’t feel any labor pains or anything"]],[637,["and just I was born; she didn’t know how."]],[640,["And I had no blood on My body, nothing, I was clean washed."]],[644,["That’s why they called My name as Nirmala."]],[649,["But My grandmother said that She should be called as Nishkalanka,"]],[654,["that means the one which has no spots on it."]],[656,["But that’s the name of man."]],[658,["So they said, “All right, we'll call Her Nirmala"]],[661,["meaning the same, Immaculata.”"]],[664,["Now all these incidents, and then My Father being a realized soul,"]],[669,["he felt tremendous vibrations from Me,"]],[672,["and he felt that this life is great"]],[676,["and She will do something great in this life."]],[682,["I do not know why, but"]],[683,["I don’t know if he dreamt or he understood it, but"]],[687,["all the time if I remember when he talked to Me,"]],[690,["he used to say that, \"You have to find out a way"]],[693,["of giving en masse Realization, all the time\"."]],[698,["As I told you, he was a great scholar of so many things,"]],[701,["and a very widely read man."]],[704,["So he gave Me a good education in religion,"]],[710,["in different religions,"]],[712,["and also good education about human beings,"]],[715,["what are their problems,"]],[717,["why they react like this, why don’t they take to God,"]],[720,["why are they hypocritical."]],[722,["All kinds of things he talked to Me."]],[725,["He also knew about Kundalini, but not so much."]],[729,["Of course, when I was born"]],[732,["I knew about Kundalini myself."]],[735,["I knew all about it from My very childhood."]],[738,["I was a very aware person, extremely aware."]],[741,["But I didn’t know whom to talk to"]],[743,["because, see, people didn’t have that awareness."]],[745,["You can’t talk to everyone like that."]],[748,["So I was regarded as a very jolly person,"]],[750,["at the same time very serious also, very deep,"]],[755,["and then I started my studies as a child."]],[761,["I was not very much interested"]],[762,["in the studies but I used to do very well,"]],[765,["but I used to read lives of great men and things like that."]],[770,["At a very young age I read Bernard Shaw."]],[773,["When people were reading just Great Expectations,"]],[776,["I was reading Bernard Shaw."]],[779,["But as such I didn’t have interest in particularly reading"]],[782,["some text books because I thought they were childish,"]],[785,["and there is nothing to be read about it."]],[788,["Then I told My father that “I have to do medicine.”"]],[791,["So he said, “Why?” I said, “Because I have to talk to doctors.”"]],[794,["He said, “You have to talk to doctors?” “Yes”, I said."]],[798,["But it so happened in My childhood"]],[800,["when I was about seven years of age,"]],[803,["My father was a congressman,"]],[805,["he had joined Congress when I was four years of age."]],[808,["He used to live with a style, very westernized."]],[811,["His clothes were stitched in London, sort of a man."]],[814,["We had governesses and all that."]],[816,["He threw away everything and he became a real Indian"]],[820,["and started leading a life of a martyr."]],[825,["Then he made us study our languages, Sanskrit..."]],[830,["He made Me study in an Indian school, not in a missionary school,"]],[835,["because missionaries were very unkind."]],[837,["They threw us out of the school when My father was in the Congress."]],[840,["They were against us completely."]],[843,["Then at the age of seven years I happened to go with My Father"]],[848,["to Mahatma Gandhi."]],[852,["He was about seventy miles, living with us,"]],[855,["but the first time he took Me down."]],[857,["And Mahatma Gandhi liked Me very much."]],[859,["He said, “Leave this child with me.”"]],[861,["So, I had not even taken clothes or anything. I stayed on;"]],[864,["then My Father sent Me everything with him."]],[869,["And he was very fond of Me, but I was a little girl,"]],[873,["but he understood that there was something about Me."]],[875,["He consulted Me on very serious problems sometimes, surprisingly."]],[881,["Like one day he wanted to"]],[883,["make the Prayer Book all right."]],[886,["So, he asked Me, “How should I put the series?” and all that."]],[890,["So I told him how to put the series"]],[892,["and he put the series in that way."]],[895,["I used to go back for My school and again go back to Gandhiji,"]],[900,["every year, like that. And he called Me Nepali."]],[904,["He'd given Me a name Nepali."]],[906,["Everybody used to call Me Nepali that time."]],[910,["Then I grew up with him very intimately."]],[914,["He was a very, very kind person for children,"]],[917,["otherwise an extremely strict man,"]],[919,["with himself and with others, very strict, a big disciplinarian."]],[923,["And he would make everybody get up at four o’clock,"]],[927,["have your baths, everything, be ready for your morning prayers"]],[931,["at five o’clock, you see, and he used to walk very fast."]],[933,["I also learnt walking fast with him."]],[935,["In his company I had to walk fast."]],[938,["And he was extremely loving and a very nice person,"]],[942,["and he would listen to Me because I was a child, you see."]],[945,["Supposing I forced him to eat more or something,"]],[947,["then he would, in laugh he would accept."]],[950,["Very kindly person."]],[952,["But with others was very strict, and I used to tell him that,"]],[955,["“Why are you strict with everyone?”"]],[958,["He said, “But You are a little girl, You get up in the morning time."]],[961,["Why can’t they get up?” I said, “I am little. That’s why I get up."]],[964,["They are big so they can’t get up”; like that, you see, little chats."]],[969,["And then My father went to jail"]],[971,["and My mother also went to jail five times."]],[973,["My father went to jail twice,"]],[975,["once for about two and a half years,"]],[977,["and he was the only supporting member of the family."]],[980,["By the way, we come from a very old royal family,"]],[984,["which is called as Shalivahanas. They have a Calendar also in India."]],[990,["And then when we, I mean when they took My father to jail,"]],[997,["we had to leave our house and we had to live in huts"]],[999,["and in all problems, that was nothing."]],[1002,["But also Me"]],[1004,["they pestered a lot, because I helped many people there"]],[1007,["and I joined the ’42 movement in a very serious way"]],[1010,["and I became the leader here for the young people."]],[1012,["I thought unless and until I take a very positive stand,"]],[1016,["it may not work out with them."]],[1020,["It’s not gracious to say how they tortured Me, what they did to Me,"]],[1025,["but they really tortured Me."]],[1026,["I was a young girl of nineteen years that time."]],[1030,["It is over now. So, it’s finished, and after that we,"]],[1034,["My father went to jail again"]],[1037,["and then when he came back"]],[1039,["he got elected as the member of the Central Assembly later on,"]],[1044,["as the Constituent Assembly and then at the Parliament."]],[1048,["My brother was also a member of the Parliament, later on."]],[1052,["Now, recently, he was the Minister in the Cabinet."]],[1057,["Another brother is a High Court judge in Bombay."]],[1062,["They are all doing well, despite the fact"]],[1064,["that our parents neglected us in a way"]],[1067,["because they gave their lives for the country"]],[1069,["but, you see, that never deterred us from studies"]],[1073,["and we came up very well."]],[1075,["Then I, when I was in the ’42 movement, you see,"]],[1078,["My college rusticated Me"]],[1080,["– from the college they threw Me out"]],[1082,["and I had to go to another college to study"]],[1085,["far away from My house, in Punjab,"]],[1089,["where I studied for two years."]],[1092,["Science I did, then I did my medical."]],[1097,["I didn’t do fully because, just after that the ’47 riots broke out,"]],[1102,["so our college was closed and I didn’t want to know more"]],[1105,["because what I wanted to know I came to know about it."]],[1108,["So I did not need and I got married."]],[1112,["You must have heard My husband was, is now"]],[1115,["the Secretary-General of the International Maritime Organization."]],[1118,["He held very high positions."]],[1120,["He was also Secretary to Lal Bahadur Shastri,"]],[1124,["who was our Prime Minister, who was a another very great man,"]],[1128,["but he did not survive long. If he had survived"]],[1131,["things would have been different, I think, for our country"]],[1134,["because he was a Gandhian, out and out Gandhian,"]],[1137,["and he lived like an ideal Gandhian personality."]],[1142,["So that’s how the life went on."]],[1146,["But inner being was still seeking the way and methods"]],[1152,["of giving en masse Realization."]],[1155,["My father said, “Before You do not develop this technique"]],[1160,["of giving en masse Realization, don’t talk of religion."]],[1163,["Let nobody know that You know anything about it"]],[1166,["because they’ll crucify You,” or"]],[1169,["he was rather worried that people won’t understand"]],[1172,["or, ‘You may write another Bible or Geeta. No use."]],[1174,["First of all you must give them Realization."]],[1178,["If they get their Realization"]],[1179,["then they will realize that there is something about,"]],[1182,["above this human awareness”."]],[1185,["For example, he always used to give an analogy -"]],[1188,["supposing you are born on the tenth storey"]],[1191,["and everybody is on the ground,"]],[1193,["you must at least make them climb two storeys,"]],[1195,["so they know there is something above it;"]],[1197,["otherwise no use talking about it."]],[1200,["And he said this is the mistake"]],[1202,["between the saints and the incarnations was"]],[1205,["that they never realized that these people are still on the ground,"]],[1209,["they have to still enter into the building."]],[1213,["So that is what you have to be very careful"]],[1215,["that first of all you must give Realization to people."]],[1219,["So I was seeking the ways and methods,"]],[1223,["working it out inside Myself"]],[1225,["through My own style of meditation in the sense that"]],[1229,["I would work out all the permutations and combinations."]],[1231,["Supposing I met one person, then I would see"]],[1235,["what problems that person had, how you can overcome it like that."]],[1239,["I would try to study that person internally."]],[1244,["And I went to many people to find out,"]],[1246,["but I found they were great hypocrites."]],[1249,["I saw so many of these gurus."]],[1251,["Most of them I saw them, I was surprised, they were all hypocrites,"]],[1255,["money-making and this thing."]],[1257,["And also I went to Rajneesh also, to see him."]],[1261,["Then he said that I should come to his program."]],[1265,["I did not know what sort of man"]],[1266,["because he was talking about Geeta and big, big things."]],[1269,["I thought he might be knowing something about it."]],[1271,["I went there, but my husband said,"]],[1273,["“No, I won't allow You to go to his camp”"]],[1275,["So he arranged his own bungalow and all that for Me."]],[1278,["So I went down there"]],[1279,["and there I couldn't see all the things that were going on"]],[1282,["and that is the day somehow or other"]],[1285,["I said I must open the last chakra. So the last chakra was opened."]],[1289,["And I saw the Kundalini which is the Primordial force within us,"]],[1295,["which is the Holy Ghost within us,"]],[1298,["rising like a telescope, opening out,"]],[1302,["and then I saw the whole thing open"]],[1306,["and a big torrential rain of breeze"]],[1310,["started flowing through My head all over,"]],[1314,["as if, and I felt \"I am lost now. I am no more there."]],[1317,["It’s only the Grace is there, that is there.\""]],[1320,["I saw it completely happening to Me."]],[1323,["And, but I was amazed that when I went to Rajneesh, you see,"]],[1329,["because before going I had to say goodbye."]],[1331,["He never realized what had happened or anything."]],[1334,["So I was surprised."]],[1335,["I said, “This man doesn’t know anything about God”,"]],[1338,["and then I discovered that they were all hypocrites"]],[1341,["and telling lies."]],[1342,["So in 1973 this happened, on 5th of May"]],[1348,["’70, 1970, 5-th of May."]],[1351,["And just after that"]],[1353,["we had a very big lecture in Jahangir Hall - there's a very big hall -"]],[1357,["and thousands of people had come. I told them very frankly"]],[1361,["that these are all thugs and these are like this, hypocrites."]],[1363,["Some of them are demoniacs. Some are evil people."]],[1366,["I took their names, everything. I told them, “Don’t go near them.”"]],[1370,["There were some foreigners also."]],[1405,["And there were so many others whom I told these things very clearly,"]],[1410,["and they got frightened. They said, “You shouldn’t say like this."]],[1413,["They’ll come and murder you. They’ll do...\""]],[1414,["”I said, “Let them come and murder Me.”"]],[1416,["But nobody did anything. Nobody even went to the courts."]],[1420,["And that’s how, you see, they tried to bring bad name to Me."]],[1425,["They paid money to the newspapers to publish things against Me,"]],[1429,["because I said, “You cannot pay money.”"]],[1431,["So they thought that I was just trying to, you see, harm them"]],[1436,["by saying such a thing that you can’t earn money in the name of God."]],[1440,["If it’s a job you can do it, but God’s work is not a job."]],[1444,["And the struggle started"]],[1449,["from the day I started giving Realization,"]],[1452,["and I started with one lady who got Realization first."]],[1457,["Then we got about twelve people who got Realization."]],[1461,["In two years I got only about fourteen people Realization."]],[1467,["Then gradually when fourteen people got Realization then"]],[1470,["many others started getting Realization."]],[1473,["But I started also curing people because that was helping a lot."]],[1478,["Then My husband got elected to this post"]],[1483,["and we had to come to London."]],[1485,["So when I came to London"]],[1487,["we had one program in Bhartiya Vidya Bhavan. They arranged it."]],[1491,["So the Indians abroad are not so much interested in God;"]],[1494,["they are more interested in money."]],[1496,["So none of the Indians stayed there. They all ran away."]],[1500,["And only the foreigners who were there, were about seven hippies."]],[1506,["So I had to work on them, seven hippies."]],[1508,["For four years I was working on them, to give them Realization."]],[1512,["Very difficult, you see. Their liver was bad."]],[1514,["They had ill health. Their head was off, terrible times."]],[1518,["But in between I used to go to India,"]],[1520,["and in India also the work was done."]],[1523,["For three months always I would be in India."]],[1525,["So we started working in the villages,"]],[1527,["specially surprisingly where My forefathers were ruling,"]],[1530,["in that area, the work started moving in a very big way."]],[1534,["And there then we started taking some people from India."]],[1538,["Then some people came from Australia to India, like that,"]],[1543,["and the work started moving in those directions."]],[1547,["Then gradually the work improved and people found"]],[1551,["that this is the way we can transform ourselves."]],[1554,["Many people who were taking drugs or alcoholic"]],[1557,["or mad people, or cancer people ,"]],[1560,["they felt better, then they got cured"]],[1563,["and it was established that Sahaja Yoga is something very important."]],[1569,["Now when I travel all over the world,"]],[1573,["you see, first My husband used to pay for everything."]],[1576,["Wherever I went, he had to pay all."]],[1578,["Any expenses he used to do for Me."]],[1581,["Gradually, then now, these people pay for My travel,"]],[1584,["but otherwise they don’t have to pay for anything else"]],[1588,["That’s how we started our work. There was lot of opposition"]],[1593,["and the media people would never understand it,"]],[1597,["because it was no such a sensation as you can say,"]],[1602,["nothing to people feel excited."]],[1603,["But in a way it’s a very great thing,"]],[1605,["because if this is the solution for the whole world."]],[1608,["One should try to do it."]],[1610,["Then we had very great people who came to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1615,["like, we can say,"]],[1620,["the Hague High Court judge, who is now the President,"]],[1625,["who has given Nicaragua, this thing judgment."]],[1630,["He and many lawyers and many barristers."]],[1634,["We have one barrister here from Algeria,"]],[1637,["and doctors, and then they took over"]],[1640,["and they started helping Me out how to propagate Sahaja Yoga."]],[1646,["But it was a difficult task in the West."]],[1649,["Of course, in India it spread very fast in the villages"]],[1651,["but city people in India also"]],[1653,["are westernized and they start analyzing."]],[1656,["They don’t know much about our past."]],[1658,["They don’t know anything about our heritage,"]],[1661,["that we have our Kundalini and all that."]],[1663,["But some people do know about self-Realization."]],[1666,["But these gurus could not stick on in India"]],[1668,["because nobody would accept them. So they all run away abroad."]],[1672,["And that was something a blessing for Me also"]],[1674,["because I didn’t have to fight them there,"]],[1677,["and it started working out,"]],[1680,["and then people found that it helps in every way,"]],[1683,["and they found so many miracles about it,"]],[1686,["and that’s how Sahaja Yoga got settled quite a lot."]],[1690,["But still I would say that"]],[1692,["we have not been to certain countries so far,"]],[1694,["and in the west, I would say that so much work has still to be done."]],[1699,["Because as soon as you start any work in any place,"]],[1703,["first of all they want Me to cure people"]],[1706,["and to help them with curatives."]],[1709,["Now if I pay attention more to that,"]],[1711,["then the main work is to create doctors out of everyone."]],[1715,["That is neglected. Then you become unpopular."]],[1718,["They think, “Oh, She is not sympathetic” and this and that."]],[1721,["But now as we have, everybody can cure now,"]],[1723,["everyone. I don’t cure anyone directly."]],[1726,["But they don’t like it. They want I should be there"]],[1728,["and their ego to be pampered and all those things are there."]],[1731,["Rather difficult."]],[1733,["It’s not, we are not running an election, you see,"]],[1735,["like we should please others sort of thing, is not there."]],[1738,["But whatever is reality,"]],[1740,["if a person has intelligence – pure intelligence"]],[1745,["– he can see that this is something very different"]],[1748,["and for that one has to"]],[1751,["understand that you cannot,"]],[1755,["you cannot force on anyone that \"You get your Realization\"."]],[1760,["In the same way you cannot force Me that I give you Realization,"]],[1765,["because if it does not work, it does not work."]],[1767,["It’s such a living force, you see."]],[1769,["And that upsets them very soon."]],[1772,["I feel that the way"]],[1775,["this industrial revolution has come in the west,"]],[1780,["people have lost their moorings, perhaps. They are so confused."]],[1784,["With all these gurus coming down here confusing them"]],[1787,["and all kinds of new things coming, they don’t know where to look."]],[1791,["But unless and until you get your evolution completed,"]],[1796,["unless and until you reach that absolute state of understanding,"]],[1799,["the chaos will remain."]],[1801,["So one has to try to get to that."]],[1804,["But one must understand you can’t pay for it. There is no effort."]],[1809,["After getting Realization"]],[1810,["they feel so satisfied, they forget about it."]],[1813,["But after that you must know how to give it to others."]],[1816,["As Christ has said that the light which is enlightened,"]],[1820,["you do not put it under the table."]],[1822,["That’s how what happens that,"]],[1824,["it's a, though we may give Realization at hundred people,"]],[1827,["only out of that five to six will come forward to help us out."]],[1831,["But still I must say lot of work has been done."]],[1834,["Especially Austria, I am very proud of Austria."]],[1837,["And the way they have never given Me any problem – never –"]],[1842,["and very good people have come out of Austria."]],[1845,["Very balanced, you see, level-headed people, very level-headed."]],[1851,["They are not extremists. They do not go to extremes."]],[1854,["There is no fanaticism about them. They are sensible people,"]],[1858,["and something so lucky that Austria was found out"]],[1863,["because I never expected that in Austria"]],[1866,["there will be so many people. But somehow"]],[1869,["like water finds its own level, Sahaja Yoga finds its own level."]],[1873,["We just came down to Austria."]],[1875,["We haven’t been to Norway, to Sweden, Denmark, Finland."]],[1880,["I visited those places because of My husband’s job"]],[1883,["but I have not been there."]],[1886,["Now we have sixteen centers in Australia,"]],[1892,["and Australia is a very progressive Sahaja Yoga thing."]],[1896,["We have got schools now there. They are running schools"]],[1899,["and the teachers are extremely well-behaved and visionaries,"]],[1905,["and they look after the children very well."]],[1908,["The Government people sent somebody for observation"]],[1913,["and they have remarked that whatever they proclaim,"]],[1916,["that’s what they manifest,"]],[1918,["and they have given good certificates to us."]],[1921,["But the greatest achievement on the outward life is this,"]],[1925,["that Cambridge University has accepted Sahaja Yoga"]],[1928,["for a research work, with respect, by one Dr. Lee,"]],[1932,["who is doing the research about Sahaja Yoga in Cambridge University."]],[1935,["He is already a Doctor."]],[1937,["And there is another great thing has happened in Delhi University,"]],[1941,["that the Delhi University has accepted"]],[1944,["that a person can do, only a doctor can do, a PhD,"]],[1950,["or we can say the Doctorate in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1953,["and he gets the highest degree called the Doctor of Medicine,"]],[1959,["and perhaps maybe after sometime they will allow anyone to do that."]],[1964,["This is about the medicine part of it."]],[1966,["In agriculture we have done lots of research, Myself."]],[1969,["We have somebody here, an expert on agriculture."]],[1972,["He has also done lot of research,"]],[1975,["and we found out, that with vibrations we start after Realization,"]],[1980,["if you vibrate the water and if you water the plants with that,"]],[1985,["then sometimes you might get even ten times more breed."]],[1988,["That’s what they did in India, in one of the Agricultural University."]],[1993,["But here also he’s found out that there’s tremendous difference"]],[1996,["between the growth of an ordinary thing."]],[1999,["Another thing we have found out in agriculture,"]],[2001,["that if you give vibrations then"]],[2003,["even an ordinary cow can give lot of milk."]],[2008,["But if you have hybrid cows then, you see,"]],[2011,["it’s not good for the brain,"]],[2012,["because a person who takes hybrid milk, also gets hybrid."]],[2016,["I mean his brain becomes little wobbly."]],[2019,["So better to have a pure milk from a cow"]],[2022,["which is not been put to this kind of a experimentation."]],[2027,["Moreover, food also, if it’s hybrid food,"]],[2029,["it’s not very good for us because that spoils our nerves, I think."]],[2033,["But ordinary seeds you cannot use because they have weakened"]],[2037,["and they cannot reproduce."]],[2039,["So when we vibrate them"]],[2042,["they produce very well just like,"]],[2044,["better than even sometimes, hybrid thing,"]],[2047,["and the food, it tastes very well"]],[2049,["and it doesn’t give those complications."]],[2051,["So this can help in agriculture in India,"]],[2054,["and the government has allotted us lot of land"]],[2057,["where we are going to now experiment,"]],[2059,["and we are going to start the experimentation there"]],[2062,["to show that how we can use this."]],[2065,["But many farmers who are Sahaja Yogis have done a lot of job"]],[2068,["and they have discovered that even animals"]],[2072,["and this, what you call,"]],[2075,["farming, everything is helped very much by vibration."]],[2080,["So it improves the lives of people."]],[2082,["We have on the other side, social side, I can tell you that"]],[2087,["we have our marriages – international marriages."]],[2090,["We arrange international marriages between people."]],[2095,["They have to know each other and they are together."]],[2101,["And first of all they are together for one or half month"]],[2105,["with us in the tour. They see each other"]],[2107,["and their marriages are fixed."]],[2109,["And we have seen that such marriages are extremely successful."]],[2113,["Ninety-nine percent marriages are successful."]],[2115,["Once in a while, maybe a mishap,"]],[2117,["but mostly there are no divorces that take place."]],[2120,["Once in a while if it’s not successful"]],[2122,["we have no objection to divorce also,"]],[2124,["but mostly it is successful and they get children"]],[2127,["who are very intelligent,"]],[2129,["who are themselves born realized children, mostly."]],[2132,["So the problem is much less and the family life improves."]],[2135,["The quality of life is thousand times better."]],[2139,["People are very joyous, happy, they do not complain,"]],[2142,["and they enjoy life and they give to others."]],[2144,["They share what joy they have. So …"]],[2148,["I: Can I ask a question?"]],[2149,["What do you think are the important points"]],[2151,["in the education of children,"]],[2153,["what are important to give to the children?"]],[2156,["You see, first if they get Realization,"]],[2159,["to get first time to that point of Realization..."]],[2162,["If they are already born realized no problem,"]],[2164,["but if they have, they're given Realization,"]],[2167,["then, you see, they start seeing from a different level."]],[2170,["They become the Spirit. So their self-respect, you see, awaken."]],[2175,["Such children behave in a very dignified, elderly manner, you see."]],[2180,["They talk in a very elderly manner"]],[2183,["and this gives solutions of all kinds, you see."]],[2185,["And they are tremendous people."]],[2188,["But we have to guide them properly by our own behavior,"]],[2192,["how we behave. The greatest thing is how we behave."]],[2196,["That’s how the children learn."]],[2197,["We put the children certain"]],[2202,["to some tests, how they are."]],[2204,["We find out if they have any physical problems, we cure them."]],[2208,["If they have mental problem, we cure them."]],[2210,["If they have any other problem, social problem or anything,"]],[2214,["we try to help them out."]],[2215,["So that basically if a human being is all right in the childhood,"]],[2220,["then fundamentals are all right for the child."]],[2223,["The foundation is laid down."]],[2224,["Then to build a child up into a good quality is not difficult."]],[2229,["So now we find great artists are there,"]],[2232,["there are great musicians"]],[2235,["and at a very young age they have started playing violin..."]],[2238,["I mean suddenly they have become dynamic also and very humble."]],[2242,["They are very humble and self-respectfing and very well-behaved."]],[2245,["It's surprising how the atmosphere is and how it works out."]],[2249,["And the other day the lady asked Me about the women"]],[2253,["and I told her that a woman’s power as a mother is very great."]],[2257,["And she felt hurt about it. But I didn’t mean"]],[2259,["that you should be just a mother. What I am saying,"]],[2261,["she is a mother, means she is compassionate, she is kind,"]],[2265,["she is not aggressive like men."]],[2267,["That is a very big quality."]],[2268,["That is a very big power in a woman. That is what I was suggesting"]],[2272,["that that is what we have to earn,"]],[2273,["is not to compete with men. It's madness to compete with men,"]],[2278,["and to go about like that, because..."]],[2293,["You see we have to understand that life"]],[2297,["has to be enjoyable."]],[2302,["Life is to be a blessing, not to be a misery."]],[2306,["We create our own miseries by these false ideas,"]],[2309,["by our own conflictions we have in our mind,"]],[2315,["mental projections we have in our mind,"]],[2317,["or our own obstinacy – whatever it is."]],[2320,["All these things can be cured"]],[2322,["if you take to Sahaja Yoga"]],[2324,["because you become a balanced person, level-headed, wise person."]],[2328,["And you become a witness."]],[2329,["The whole thing becomes like a show, like a drama."]],[2331,["And you become fearless,"]],[2333,["you start seeing the whole thing like a drama."]],[2335,["And this is what a human being has to achieve."]],[2337,["We talk of peace. We talk of no war."]],[2341,["We talk of many things like this, you see,"]],[2343,["atomic bomb, this, that... All that is not going to work out."]],[2347,["Only what is going to work out"]],[2348,["is the transformation of human beings."]],[2350,["If the human beings are transformed,"]],[2352,["things will work out absolutely first class."]],[2355,["Not only that, but that they will enjoy the bliss of life."]],[2361,["We are missing the point altogether!"]],[2364,["This is a very important thing"]],[2367,["that human beings must say, one thing:"]],[2369,["what have we achieved out of all these?"]],[2371,["Just for a minute to stop and think."]],[2376,["What would you say is the definition of illness?"]],[2378,["What's the causes of illness?"]],[2382,["It’s the physical, mental, emotional, all illnesses are caused"]],[2386,["by the imbalances within us, by our extreme behavior."]],[2390,["And supposing say now the cancer. We can take the cancer."]],[2394,["Cancer is caused by the over-activity"]],[2397,["of the sympathetic nervous system."]],[2400,["Now supposing a person is a very sad person."]],[2406,["He cries and weeps and all the time feels guilty"]],[2409,["and thinks that he is the worst person ever born,"]],[2412,["he’s committed so many sins and all sorts of nonsense, you see."]],[2416,["Then he goes to the left side, according to us"]],[2418,["and crosses over to the collective subconscious area."]],[2421,["And there, according to us, what they call as Protein 58,"]],[2425,["and Protein 52, doctors call it that way,"]],[2428,["but we call it as the dead souls;"]],[2430,["they exist there and they catch hold of you"]],[2433,["and they trigger the cancer."]],[2435,["But supposing by any chance"]],[2437,["you can bring the attention fully away from that"]],[2440,["in the center you can get cured."]],[2443,["So it is the centers within us which are subtle,"]],[2447,["which are basically seven centers."]],[2449,["There are many others, but basically seven."]],[2451,["If you can put them right,"]],[2453,["you cannot have any sickness or illness, of any kind."]],[2459,["Let's go back to your childhood."]],[2462,["Can You explain - Your parents"]],[2467,["supported You very much in Your learning and in Your studies."]],[2471,["It’s correct? [unclear]"]],[2473,["Yes, yes. Of course. You see in..."]],[2477,["Is this normal"]],[2478,["that parents support the child like You in Your family?"]],[2481,["In India, all parents support the child."]],[2484,["- Even if...","- You can learn everything what You want to?"]],[2487,["Yes, yes, I mean, that is true."]],[2489,["But you see the basic thing is"]],[2491,["parents are very benevolent to children, very kind to children,"]],[2495,["and to them, you see, the child’s education, child’s upbringing"]],[2500,["and child’s life is very important."]],[2503,["That’s why we know they are, so we depend on them,"]],[2507,["they look after us and they are very wise people."]],[2510,["They sacrifice everything for us."]],[2513,["So, whatever they say we think it’s nice"]],[2516,["and by doing this we have not lost anything so far."]],[2519,["In India if you find Indian children when they come abroad"]],[2522,["they always talk the least anywhere."]],[2524,["They are very obedient children"]],[2526,["and they behave very well."]],[2529,["We don’t have all this problem, teenage problem, homosexual."]],[2532,["We don’t know even all this problems are"]],[2534,["because we are so close with the parents all the time."]],[2536,["They all the time watch us. We don’t have drug problem,"]],[2539,["none of these. Only in the cities, little bit,"]],[2542,["it happens and it disappears;"]],[2544,["because parents are all the time with their children."]],[2546,["We live together. The whole family lives together."]],[2549,["And not only with the parents"]],[2550,["but all the relations and all the people"]],[2553,["in the village and the city, everyone knows each other."]],[2556,["Such a joint system we have"]],[2559,["that we do not normally,"]],[2563,["sort of, go into wrong ways and methods"]],[2567,["and we do not become obstinate also."]],[2570,["- But, You grew up in a Christian family in India.","- Yes."]],[2572,["Yes."]],[2574,["It’s not a normal situation, that Indian people are Christian."]],[2578,["Yes, I know. It is, you see,"]],[2580,["I was born in a Christian family deliberately,"]],[2583,["because I think, you see, I personally think,"]],[2587,["that Protestants are the greatest fanatics;"]],[2590,["because they are very sophisticated, you see,"]],[2592,["their fanaticism is in their brain."]],[2594,["Nobody can make them out of their fanaticism."]],[2596,["They are very great fanatics, the greatest of all."]],[2598,["But My parents were very enlightened people"]],[2601,["and they understood Christ very well."]],[2603,["Yesterday I told you about Paul, you see, when I was -"]],[2606,["first time I took the Bible in the hand"]],[2608,["and I asked My father, “Who is this Paul?”."]],[2610,["He said “He is an intruder. Forget him. Don’t read him at all.”"]],[2613,["So you see they understood all these things very well"]],[2616,["and because My father was a realized soul,"]],[2618,["like Khalil Gibran, you see. If you read Khalil Gibran,"]],[2621,["he says the same thing about Paul, the same thing."]],[2623,["So, you see, if you are an enlightened person,"]],[2626,["you see the essence of everything."]],[2628,["Whatever religion you may be born,"]],[2630,["you don’t ignore any other religion."]],[2633,["You try to learn about other religion,"]],[2635,["and you find the essence is the same in every religion."]],[2638,["What is there to fight?"]],[2639,["And that’s how you belong to no religion,"]],[2641,["you belong to every religion. That’s what happens."]],[2644,["But My parents were very enlightened people, I must say,"]],[2648,["and I was very lucky to choose them as My parents."]],[2652,["You have been an enlightened child, is it correct?"]],[2655,["- I beg your pardon?","- You had been an enlightened child?"]],[2658,["Yes, I have been born as an enlightened child."]],[2660,["But You don’t feel sometimes very lonesome,"]],[2663,["because all the others are different?"]],[2668,["No, no, that is, you see, if you know how to share with others..."]],[2672,["Actually I was like a Mother to them from My very childhood."]],[2676,["When My father, mother went to jail I was,"]],[2678,["first time, I was about, I think five and a half years of age."]],[2681,["So I had all the keys of the house in My little frock thing,"]],[2686,["and I used to carry all the duties like a grandmother."]],[2689,["I never felt lost. I mean,"]],[2692,["My life is on the whole is very collective,"]],[2694,["by temperament I am extremely collective."]],[2697,["I can live anywhere. I can sleep anywhere."]],[2700,["I can live in the jungles. I can..."]],[2702,["I have no problems of that. I am extremely collective."]],[2705,["I am not exclusive by temperament, from very childhood."]],[2709,["I was very friendly with all the people"]],[2712,["in that area where we were living"]],[2714,["and My mother was known as Nirmala’s mother,"]],[2717,["father was known as Nirmala’s father."]],[2718,["So they said, “We have lost our identity because of Her”."]],[2721,["So I was a very friendly person. I never felt lonely,"]],[2725,["and when I am with Myself I am never lonely at all."]],[2728,["I enjoy Myself very much."]],[2734,["When You had been to the ashram with Gandhi,"]],[2738,["can You mention one or two impressions You remember"]],[2742,["about Gandhi?"]],[2745,["Oh! Gandhiji was a tremendous man."]],[2746,["One has to learn a lot from him."]],[2749,["He was not at all a hypocrite, that’s one thing."]],[2752,["And he was not like modern, we say, politicians,"]],[2757,["who says something, do something. No, he was very outspoken"]],[2761,["and always put himself on the testing point."]],[2765,["And he used to confess if he made mistakes, immediately."]],[2769,["One very great incident I remember, when I was a small child."]],[2774,["They were having a meeting together"]],[2777,["and we girls were there only sitting giving them"]],[2781,["water and things, to all the people."]],[2783,["All the big people were there, like..."]],[2787,["Jawaharlal Lal Nehru was there and also Maulana Azad,"]],[2790,["all these people were sitting there."]],[2792,["They were discussing something and then suddenly"]],[2795,["Mahatmaji said that, “Now it’s very late. We’ll have lunch here.”"]],[2800,["So they said, “Yes, yes, we’ll have lunch here.”"]],[2803,["They had to go to the guest house which was far away."]],[2806,["So Mahatmaji asked for the Baa, is his wife. She had gone out."]],[2812,["So he got up. He had a key with him,"]],[2814,["you see, always of the store room."]],[2816,["He opened the store room,"]],[2817,["and he asked the people who were in charge of cooking"]],[2821,["to measure everything"]],[2823,["according to the people there are, properly, everything, you see."]],[2827,["And then he, and they measured it out, everything was done"]],[2830,["then he put the key back,"]],[2832,["and then he went and sat there nicely."]],[2834,["So these people said,"]],[2836,["“Bapu, we did not know you had to take so much trouble,"]],[2840,["you see, to go all the way and measure out everything out for us.”"]],[2844,["It did not take much time, about fifteen minutes, but still."]],[2847,["So he said, “What do you think?"]],[2849,["This is the blood of my country. I cannot allow it to be wasted”."]],[2854,["See, that’s the sign of a person who understands"]],[2857,["the value of public money. That’s just ingrained in him,"]],[2861,["but those who saw him also felt"]],[2865,["that, \"Look at this man, who is living like an ascetic, absolutely,"]],[2869,["in the sense that he would not touch the public money\"."]],[2872,["And that is one of the key, keys for all the leaders."]],[2876,["If they are absolutely above the money,"]],[2880,["then only people will respect; otherwise, there is no way out."]],[2884,["But you find these days in every country"]],[2886,["so much of corruption, hypocrisy,"]],[2889,["then you are really shocked."]],[2892,["What do You think is the reason"]],[2894,["of all these corruption, of the political instability?"]],[2899,["It’s ignorance. It is ignorance."]],[2902,["They think by having money or by having big position"]],[2907,["or by having a big name, they’ll be happy."]],[2912,["They will not be happy. Only the ego will be pampered."]],[2916,["When it is slightly hurt, the person will be unhappy."]],[2919,["So he’ll be going into from happiness to unhappiness."]],[2923,["But when he gets the knowledge"]],[2926,["that it is the Spirit which is the source of joy,"]],[2929,["then he doesn’t care for money, he doesn’t care for all these things."]],[2933,["He is not afraid of anything. He lives like a Lord himself."]],[2936,["He is a Lord, he doesn’t want anything."]],[2938,["You see, the one who is the Lord doesn’t want anything."]],[2941,["For example, now, as you know, I come from a rich family,"]],[2944,["my husband from a rich family."]],[2946,["He’s now well to do. We have very comfortable living,"]],[2949,["but I can live in a, on a street, I can sleep on a street,"]],[2953,["because I am like a queen. I don’t need anything."]],[2956,["If you need anything then you are a beggar,"]],[2959,["otherwise you are a king, isn’t it?"]],[2961,["That’s what I feel. So that is what is the ignorance."]],[2965,["Once they know we are just fighting our ignorance"]],[2969,["they’ll give it up. It’s nonsense."]],[2971,["It is nonsense and it’s not at all joy giving."]],[2974,["Your virtues are very joy giving."]],[2977,["If you know about your chastity, or you know about your honesty,"]],[2982,["or if you know about your straightforwardness,"]],[2985,["it’s very joy giving."]],[2987,["You feel so confident, so happy"]],[2989,["and such a person never tries to harm anyone,"]],[2992,["to be sarcastic with anyone."]],[2993,["Such a person is absolutely free, I should say,"]],[2995,["because he has no bondages of any kind."]],[2998,["These are all bondages which bind us"]],[3000,["and we become jealous and we become greedy,"]],[3003,["we become lusty. All this is nonsense."]],[3007,["It’s to be just seen after getting to your Spirit"]],[3010,["that the light shows these are all like snakes, you see,"]],[3013,["crawling up on us and we are holding on to snakes."]],[3016,["People when they die, you see - big, big people I have seen -"]],[3019,["people tell about them."]],[3021,["In the history they go down as horrible people."]],[3024,["In the history they are described as people who were hypocrites,"]],[3027,["who were cruel, who were very, I should say, adamant type,"]],[3033,["and all kinds of things is described."]],[3035,["Whatever is genuine remains genuine."]],[3040,["You never, don’t feel frightened?"]],[3043,["No, I don’t. I don’t know anything like fear."]],[3048,["What’s there to be afraid of?"]],[3052,["I am never afraid of,"]],[3054,["because if you believe and you know definitely there is God all over,"]],[3059,["there is nothing to be afraid of."]],[3061,["He looks after you every moment, every minute."]],[3064,["Wherever you are, He looks after you."]],[3066,["These people have had so many experiences of that."]],[3069,["There was one girl who was a Sahaja Yogini"]],[3073,["and she was driving somewhere in Germany on an Autobahn,"]],[3078,["and there were so many cars were with her."]],[3080,["And suddenly her brake failed"]],[3082,["and the car started going this way, that way."]],[3084,["She didn’t know how to manage it. She said, “Now, what to do?”"]],[3087,["She just... She had another one also with her."]],[3089,["Both of them, they said,"]],[3091,["“All right, let us close our eyes and think of Mother.”"]],[3093,["They just started thinking of Me and said,"]],[3095,["“We’ll not be afraid, just think of Her”."]],[3098,["And suddenly they found that their car had come"]],[3101,["to one side of the road very nicely without any scratch."]],[3106,["So, you see, it is just our fear makes us more frantic and stupid."]],[3112,["There is nothing to be afraid of."]],[3115,["It is to be seen how God helps you."]],[3117,["But people don’t want to take His help, you see."]],[3119,["Then God says, “All right, go ahead and break your head. What to do?”"]],[3125,["Sometimes other people are helping."]],[3128,["Yes, then you should know how to handle them."]],[3131,["You see, they, for example, yesterday that fellow came."]],[3134,["You see, he just became like a beaten up dog."]],[3136,["You saw him coming and saying something to Me, which you never heard."]],[3139,["But they belong to a cult, some sort of a cult, you see,"]],[3143,["and they always oppose us. They have some sort of Christians."]],[3147,["And when I was in Geneva, one of the ladies,"]],[3152,["all, you see, dressed up in a very fashionable way,"]],[3157,["she came to Me with a Bible in her hand to hit me, you see."]],[3160,["And everybody got frightened that now she is going to beat Me."]],[3164,["This woman walked with big high heels upon Me"]],[3167,["and I dont know, they thought she’ll do something to Me."]],[3170,["As soon as I saw her with the Bible, you know,"]],[3172,["I started laughing, absolutely."]],[3174,["I couldn’t bear. I thought, “Such a joker she is."]],[3177,["She is coming to hit Me with a Bible? How can she do it?”"]],[3180,["And she got worried about Me that I am laughing so much."]],[3183,["It’s all on the tape."]],[3184,["And these boys were very much frightened, I've seen."]],[3187,["I was not at all. I said, “It’s perfectly all right,”"]],[3189,["and she ran away because she saw Me laughing, you know."]],[3192,["I just couldn’t help [unclear] laughing at the joker,"]],[3195,["the way she came to hit Me with a Bible. Imagine!"]],[3199,["So this is what it is. If you are afraid"]],[3201,["then they sit on your heads. But you should not be afraid."]],[3206,["There's a chinese story that there's one king who took two,"]],[3211,["two cocks for fighting to a very realised soul, a guru,"]],[3217,["and he said, \"You make them all right\"."]],[3220,["So he said \"All right\". He trained them for one month,"]],[3223,["and they went for a fight."]],[3224,["So many cocks were brought him to fight these."]],[3229,["So these two were standing there,"]],[3230,["they would no attack anyone, just standing."]],[3233,["Everybody was attacking, they were just standing."]],[3235,["Everybody got frightened, all the,"]],[3237,["all the cocks got frightened and ran away."]],[3240,["And these two were standing there nicely."]],[3245,["You should not attack anyone, nor anybody would attack you."]],[3251,["Yes, they are there, but quite alright."]],[3253,["But I am not frightened of them."]],[3255,["So far nobody has been successful."]],[3269,["P: I request Mataji, if Mataji can explain how to raise the Kundalini,"]],[3275,["that may help the guests also."]],[3278,["Explain how to raise the Kundalini.","P: Yes"]],[3290,["He wants to know how the Kundalini is raised."]],[3295,["As they explained the, yesterday in German language,"]],[3299,["that at the base of our spine,"]],[3303,["there is a power lying there,"]],[3306,["which is the reflection of the Holy Ghost within us."]],[3310,["And the Spirit lies in the heart"]],[3313,["which is the reflection of God Almighty."]],[3316,["So the power of God is the Holy Ghost, is a female power,"]],[3321,["because God is a male,"]],[3327,["then He has a son. There has to be a Mother to the son."]],[3333,["They didn't want to have a woman there, imagine."]],[3336,["We cannot have women for..."]],[3338,["They cannot be ordained. This is too much."]],[3341,["It's not in India like this, you see."]],[3343,["You don't find this kind of a nonsense there"]],[3345,["but is here that women have accepted, though you are so advanced."]],[3348,["There, here it is so stupid that women cannot become priests."]],[3351,["Why can't they if the men can be?"]],[3354,["So, this, to avoid the women from the whole thing,"]],[3359,["they called It a Holy Ghost, without telling that it's a female."]],[3364,["And that female power is the Shakti"]],[3367,["which resides in the triangular bone."]],[3370,["Now, what happens, that when a person who is authorised,"]],[3378,["in a way that a person who is a realised soul,"]],[3383,["is faced by such a person, then the Kundalini spontaneously rises."]],[3389,["Just like in the womb of the Mother Earth if you put any seed,"]],[3396,["spontaneously it sprouts because it's a living process."]],[3401,["And it passes through the six chakras."]],[3404,["The seventh is the last chakra, which is the pelvic,"]],[3408,["which helps the pelvic plexus."]],[3409,["So it doesn't play any part,"]],[3412,["means sex does not play any part in this. You become like a child."]],[3416,["And the Kundalini passes through six centres"]],[3418,["ultimately the sixth one is here,"]],[3421,["which we call as Sahasrara, meaning thousand petaled lotus."]],[3426,["But actually it is the limbic area,"]],[3428,["and at the apex of limbic area here, at the fontanel bone area,"]],[3433,["It pierces through,"]],[3434,["and you actually start feeling"]],[3436,["the cool breeze coming out of your head."]],[3439,["Actually start feeling like that."]],[3441,["So, it just sprouts by itself,"]],[3444,["it is a spontaneous happening."]],[3451,["Did you understand?"]],[3453,["You are from the country of Krishna, You should know many things."]],[3457,["After coming here, you people have forgotten God."]],[3461,["Is it true or not?"]]]);
